[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802415830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2802415830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2802415830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nCXjW","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T17:35:35Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T17:35:50Z","body":"[Brotli](https://github.com/google/brotli) is ungodly slow, as it is single-threaded. I'm wondering if it would be preferrable to cook up some magic in order to run instead [rust-brotli](https://github.com/dropbox/rust-brotli/). The problem here is that there's no binary to download, as it doesn't exist (yet).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802415830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802589874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2802589874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2802589874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nDCCy","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T18:32:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T18:33:02Z","body":"> [Brotli](https://github.com/google/brotli) is ungodly slow, as it is single-threaded. I'm wondering if it would be preferrable to cook up some magic in order to run instead [rust-brotli](https://github.com/dropbox/rust-brotli/). The problem here is that there's no binary to download, as it doesn't exist (yet).\r\n\r\nI just tried to compile and run `rust-brotli` from the command line, and it works. But it's not multi threaded. :\\ (the library supports multi threading, but the command line API doesn't.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802589874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802937537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2802937537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2802937537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nEW7B","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T20:42:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T20:42:11Z","body":"> I just tried to compile and run `rust-brotli` from the command line, and it works. But it's not multi threaded. :\\ (the library supports multi threading, but the command line API doesn't.)\r\n\r\nDoesn't it have a [-j argument](https://github.com/dropbox/rust-brotli/blob/6c078c0c2bc058fabdf3bb9db7b2b83c7512b4a6/src/bin/brotli.rs#L675)?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802937537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803070839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2803070839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2803070839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nE3d3","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T21:29:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T21:29:45Z","body":"> > I just tried to compile and run `rust-brotli` from the command line, and it works. But it's not multi threaded. :\\ (the library supports multi threading, but the command line API doesn't.)\n> \n> \n> \n> Doesn't it have a [-j argument](https://github.com/dropbox/rust-brotli/blob/6c078c0c2bc058fabdf3bb9db7b2b83c7512b4a6/src/bin/brotli.rs#L675)?\n\nDang it. Didn't know. I'll try it out.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803070839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2806720476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2806720476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2806720476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nSyfc","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T16:19:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T16:19:28Z","body":"So, the results of my benchmarks.\r\n\r\n### 40MiB wasm file\r\n| Binary | -j | Time |\r\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\r\n| google/brotli | n/a (-j1) | 0m58s |\r\n| dropbox/rust-brotli | -j1 (default) | 7m14s |\r\n| dropbox/rust-brotli | -j12 | 0m24s |\r\n\r\n### 695MiB wasm file\r\n| Binary | -j | Time |\r\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\r\n| google/brotli | n/a (-j1) | 24m06s |\r\n| dropbox/rust-brotli | -j1 (default) | > 72m30s (stopped it) |\r\n| dropbox/rust-brotli | -j12 | 27m39s |\r\n\r\n### Result\r\nThe results are inconclusive, so I will not support dropbox/rust-brotli.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2806720476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2855244640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105371#issuecomment-2855244640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105371","id":2855244640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qL5Ng","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T16:36:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T21:55:34Z","body":"If you can find a way to efficiently decompress Zstandard on the web platform, supporting it could be worthwhile. All modern browsers except Safari support it: https://caniuse.com/zstd\r\n\r\nIn fact, it might not be worth supporting Brotli anymore given its slow compression speeds, as gzip will remain available for Safari until it adopts Zstandard.\r\n\r\n**Edit:** `zstd --ultra -22` doesn't compress as well as `brotli --best` from my testing though: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105388#pullrequestreview-2819790805","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"u